{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2020b.q27.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下列材料并回答问题。 材料：1910年8 月，《国风报》一篇文章中写道：“我国今日之新政，固速乱之导线也。十年以来，我国朝野上下，莫不奋袂攘臂，嚣然举行新政。兴学堂也，办实业也，治警察也，行征兵也，兼营并举，目不暇给。然而多举一新政，即多增一乱端，事变益以纷挐， 国势益以抢攘。……”", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试（高中历史）题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "920db5286bcfb3478e756e7be330c4a22ad3d2110cdde2d86c357ae36a48c677", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1965, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2109, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试（高中历史）题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "920db5286bcfb3478e756e7be330c4a22ad3d2110cdde2d86c357ae36a48c677"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2020b.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2020b.q27"], "word_count": 144, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试（高中历史）题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试（高中历史）题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "920db5286bcfb3478e756e7be330c4a22ad3d2110cdde2d86c357ae36a48c677", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1965, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2109, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试（高中历史）题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "920db5286bcfb3478e756e7be330c4a22ad3d2110cdde2d86c357ae36a48c677"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "research_non_c